# Retell AI — Real Estate Voice Agent

# ─── How to get these ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Go to https://dashboard.retellai.com
# 2. API Key: Settings → API Keys → Copy your key
# 3. Agent ID: will be printed when you run `npm run setup`
#    OR copy it from Dashboard → Agents → click your agent → copy ID from URL
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

RETELL_API_KEY=your_retell_api_key_here
RETELL_AGENT_ID=your_agent_id_here
PORT=3000
